{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_206_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_206","textTraditional":"一、二十有五年，春，叔孫婼如宋。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_206_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_206","textTraditional":"二、夏，叔倪會晉趙鞅、宋樂大心、衞北宮喜、鄭游吉、曹人、邾人、滕人、薛人、小邾人於黃父。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_206_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_206","textTraditional":"三、有鸜鵒來巢。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_206_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_206","textTraditional":"一有一亡曰有。來者，來中國也。鸜鵒穴者而曰巢。或曰，增之也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_206_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_206","textTraditional":"四、秋，七月，上辛，大雩。季辛，又雩。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_206_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_206","textTraditional":"季者，有中之辭也。又，有繼之辭也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_206_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_206","textTraditional":"五、九月，己亥，公孫於齊，次於陽州，齊侯唁公於野井。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_206_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_206","textTraditional":"孫之為言猶孫也，諱奔也。次，止也。弔失國曰唁，唁公不得入於魯也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_206_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_206","textTraditional":"六、冬，十月，戊辰，叔孫婼卒。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_206_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_206","textTraditional":"七、十有一月，己亥，宋公佐卒於曲棘。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_206_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_206","textTraditional":"防公也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_206_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_206","textTraditional":"八、十有二月，齊侯取鄆。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_206_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_206","textTraditional":"取，易辭也。內不言取，以其為公取之，故易言之也。","sentenceOrder":13}],"overrides":{}}